{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Will you reach the last arena?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Penguin Gladiators is a roguelike survival arena game where you must survive and fight different battles across different arenas and outlast your opponents. Break eggs to gain power-ups, unlock characters, and craft unique builds as you face a variety of gladiator enemies. How long can you remain the last penguin standing?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700690/extras/abc2934bed980c8fef2c5e01b805d4cd.poster.avif?t=1768097235\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700690/extras/abc2934bed980c8fef2c5e01b805d4cd.webm?t=1768097235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700690/extras/abc2934bed980c8fef2c5e01b805d4cd.mp4?t=1768097235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Obey the masters condition and you win!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each arena sets its own rules for survival. Sometimes you must be the last penguin standing, other times you need to endure the fight, hunt down specific enemies, or face a powerful master of the arena. Read the situation, adapt your approach, and fight your way to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700690/extras/85dca37643564642048f75de45047291.poster.avif?t=1768097235\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700690/extras/85dca37643564642048f75de45047291.webm?t=1768097235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700690/extras/85dca37643564642048f75de45047291.mp4?t=1768097235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade and Get Stronger!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat enemies and pick up silver, gold, and ruby then trade it with the Egg Trader for an Egg. Breaking eggs unlocks random rewards such as power-ups and new characters, with higher-tier eggs granting stronger unlockables.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700690/extras/18fb6afa0ac7a4d25a2570a057b82013.poster.avif?t=1768097235\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700690/extras/18fb6afa0ac7a4d25a2570a057b82013.webm?t=1768097235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700690/extras/18fb6afa0ac7a4d25a2570a057b82013.mp4?t=1768097235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unleash your skills and Complete Quests</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dodge, roll, block, you name it! Each character you unlock has its own unique skills and weapon set which you can master to defeat your enemies. Complete over 50+ Quest from the Seer and unlock rare rewards and achievements!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3700690?t=1768097235","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700690/727ab26eaeae7e348a9f00841af5ae386bafc49b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768097235","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700690/940f837c9e0ab8c75433c94dd7991ceebb68586d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768097235","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3700690/940f837c9e0ab8c75433c94dd7991ceebb68586d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768097235","categories":[{"d